{"counts":{"canonical":23,"context":0,"total":23,"unknown_date":0,"unlinked":0},"events":[{"aliases":["Archaeological Site of Mehrgarh","泥砖","聚落"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-bf2f7311a77f802426eb3684","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-bf2f7311a77f802426eb3684","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5772d60dd6f8b81bb35ec734","summary":"梅赫尔格尔位于今巴基斯坦俾路支省的卡奇平原，靠近博兰山口和博兰河。这里保存了跨公元前第七至第三千纪的长期考古序列，地层深逾十一米。多代居民反复营建泥砖建筑，旧屋遗存被新建筑覆盖，逐渐累积成今天看到的聚落土丘。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前第七至第三千纪","end_year":-2001,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-7000},"title":"梅赫尔格尔群体连续营建泥砖聚落"},{"aliases":["Chinchorro","丧葬","遗体处理"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["钦乔罗文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5497db2bba26e3b36f16fc2b","summary":"钦乔罗文化的海洋狩猎采集群体，约在公元前5450至前890年生活于今智利北部干旱的阿塔卡马沿海。海洋资源是其生计的重要基础，遗址中发现用骨、贝壳以及矿物和植物材料制作的工具，也保存了格外复杂的葬俗证据。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5450—前890年","end_year":-890,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5450},"title":"钦乔罗海洋采集群体发展人工木乃伊葬俗"},{"aliases":["Kitakogane Site","渔业","贝丘","居住"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["绳纹文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-4ef0cd76f93ea5148e1ddd8f","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-4ef0cd76f93ea5148e1ddd8f","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-ed76ae8247c548adbfb267a6","summary":"北黄金遗址位于北海道西南部内浦湾东岸的台地，考古范围约从公元前5000年延续至前2000年。聚落包含竖穴住居、墓葬、贝丘和用水地点。大量贝壳、鱼骨与海兽骨表明，当地居民充分利用沿海水域，以捕鱼和其他海洋资源获取为重要生计。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000—前2000年","end_year":-2000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"北黄金居民以渔业为重要生计并营建聚落"},{"aliases":["transitional period","农业","城市起源"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["印度河文明"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-acead5667bb162fd5c75046c","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-acead5667bb162fd5c75046c","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-cdef436efdb8ba9b018a1331","summary":"约公元前5000至前2600年，印度河地区的一些农业聚落逐渐扩大，呈现从村落迈向城镇的变化。考古发现中，住宅和道路的布局更为清楚，聚落也常靠近适于耕作的土地或便利交换的地点。相似器物在较大区域内出现，反映不同社区之间的联系不断增多。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000年—公元前2600年","end_year":-2600,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"印度河地区迈向城市文明"},{"aliases":["Prehistoric Pile Dwellings around the Alps","居住建筑","环境利用"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-843c3d0b25516b22aa225af7","summary":"约公元前5000至前500年，阿尔卑斯及周边人群在湖岸、河边和湿地附近营建桩上聚落。列入世界遗产的系列包含多个国家的一百余处遗址，记录了新石器时代至青铜时代不同群体的居住方式。它们不是一座持续存在的城市，而是一组跨越漫长时期的聚落材料。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000—前500年","end_year":-500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"阿尔卑斯周边群体营建水边桩上聚落"},{"aliases":["Neolithic Flint Mines of Spiennes","采矿","燧石"],"body":[],"categories":["科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-3018b66a9fc5ba7f72da3494","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-3018b66a9fc5ba7f72da3494","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-4e1b20bbc314b8c6922d89c2","summary":"斯皮耶纳位于今比利时蒙斯附近，约从公元前第五千纪后段至第三千纪上半叶形成密集的地下燧石开采活动。新石器时代矿工通过竖井下到地层，再沿地下巷道接近石料。部分竖井深达十六米，反映他们已经能够针对不同石层安排复杂的取材办法。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前第五千纪末三分之一至第三千纪上半叶","end_year":-2501,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-4333},"title":"斯皮耶纳群体开采地下燧石矿"},{"aliases":["Megalithic Temples of Malta","巨石建筑"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-7c00599f2172bee57df0df8f","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-7c00599f2172bee57df0df8f","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-3c2e3ca3b2fa74f46abc623c","summary":"公元前第四至第三千纪，马耳他及戈佐岛的建造者用本地石材营建巨石庙。建筑常由立起的石板、上部横石、铺地庭院及沿中轴两侧展开的半圆形房间组成，各处平面与构造又有所不同。这些遗存表明，建造者能够根据石材性质和空间需求安排大型结构。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前第四至第三千纪","end_year":-2001,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"period","start_year":-4000},"title":"马耳他建造者以本地石材营建巨石庙"},{"aliases":["Ħal Saflieni Hypogeum","丧葬","地下建筑"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-2e3ec6f1aabad8fb48945046","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-2e3ec6f1aabad8fb48945046","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-d5868ee503eb91df232a75c6","summary":"哈尔萨夫列尼地下墓地位于今马耳他保拉，约从公元前4000至前2500年持续使用。人们使用燧石、黑曜石等石质工具和鹿角，在较软的石灰岩中凿出上下叠置的三层洞室。最早的上层由山坡开入，之后更多侧室和下层空间逐渐加入。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前4000—前2500年","end_year":-2500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-4000},"title":"马耳他群体使用哈尔萨夫列尼地下墓地"},{"aliases":["Sannai Maruyama Site","聚落规划","居住建筑"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["绳纹文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-72d9bdfeb2425fd15adcdd63","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-72d9bdfeb2425fd15adcdd63","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-25dfe157a9b45cbe1e66db48","summary":"三内丸山遗址位于今日本青森，约公元前3900至前2200年的材料呈现一处大型绳文聚落。竖穴住居、柱支建筑、成列墓葬、储藏坑、道路和人工土丘具有一定规划关系。大量陶器、石器，以及栗、核桃和鱼兽骨骼，显示居民利用河口、内湾和森林的多种资源。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3900—前2200年","end_year":-2200,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-3900},"title":"三内丸山居民按规划布置大型聚落"},{"aliases":["Stonehenge, Avebury and Associated Sites","巨石建筑","葬俗"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-43cecb4a48bf8b2c4103592d","images":[{"caption":"巨石阵现存遗迹，Diego Delso于2014年摄影。","creator":"Diego Delso","credit":"Diego Delso / Wikimedia Commons / CC BY-SA 4.0","depiction_type":"modern_site_photograph","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","obligations":["保留作者、来源和许可证链接。","如改编图像，注明修改并以相同或兼容许可分享改编图像。","不对图像另加与本许可冲突的使用限制。"],"rights_revision_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3AStonehenge%2C+Condado+de+Wiltshire%2C+Inglaterra%2C+2014-08-12%2C+DD+09.JPG&oldid=1285433761","sha256":"d2c6f7394b6cc04109e8a8eaa0ad1e0061c239f3897b25da545d11f93386375f","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stonehenge,_Condado_de_Wiltshire,_Inglaterra,_2014-08-12,_DD_09.JPG","src":"/api/history/assets/AS-d2c6f7394b6cc04109e8a8eaa0ad1e0061c239f3897b25da545d11f93386375f.jpg"}],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-43cecb4a48bf8b2c4103592d","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-2a8e8317c58e269b1e5f1be8","summary":"约公元前3700至前1600年，今英国威尔特郡的巨石阵、埃夫伯里及周边地区持续营建和使用仪式性景观。这里不只有著名石圈，还包括大道、围沟、木构遗迹和多种墓葬。石材与土方建筑之间的位置关系，显示不同世代不断改变并重新利用同一地区。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3700—前1600年","end_year":-1600,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-3700},"title":"巨石阵与埃夫伯里地区营建并使用仪式景观"},{"aliases":["来源未给独立事件专名；据所列遗址、器物或行动描述拟题。","聚落","台湾史前史"],"body":[],"categories":["文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-5d81c6ee9b97692db3883faa","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-5d81c6ee9b97692db3883faa","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-48e275a7bcc0d9c06c69b528","summary":"约公元前3500至前2000年，台湾新石器时代的聚落数量和规模出现明显变化。所引研究汇集淡水河流域、台湾东部及其他地区的遗址资料，指出一些地方从早期少数聚落发展到中期数十处聚落，部分中期遗址的面积也远大于早期遗址。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3500—前2000年","end_year":-2000,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-3500},"title":"台湾新石器时代的人口扩展阶段"},{"aliases":["来源未给独立事件专名；据所列遗址、器物或行动描述拟题。","高原农业","家畜","彩陶"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-6b230cc95c2f92dcfc0b5932","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-6b230cc95c2f92dcfc0b5932","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-db6a9404168fc51bc82a9d82","summary":"昌都卡若遗址位于青藏高原，所引研究将相关材料置于约公元前3500至前2200年。遗址中见有家猪、彩陶以及粟、黍等谷物，为讨论高原早期居民的动物饲养和作物利用提供实物证据。这些材料也使卡若能够同四川西部等地区的史前遗存比较。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3500—前2200年","end_year":-2200,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-3500},"title":"昌都卡若的家猪遗存"},{"aliases":["来源未给独立事件专名；据所列遗址、器物或行动描述拟题。","城市","稻作","水利"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-93b17d91c328ecf3effb809c","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-93b17d91c328ecf3effb809c","record_type":"site","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-4bf099f668e849e85fc33749","summary":"约公元前3300至前2300年的良渚古城遗址，呈现长江下游以稻作农业为重要支撑的早期复杂社会。遗产范围包括城址、瑶山遗址以及谷口高坝、平原低坝等区域。大型土质建筑、城市规划和水利设施，使居住空间、生产基础与公共营建能够作为整体考察。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3300—前2300年","end_year":-2300,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-3300},"title":"良渚古城及其稻作社会"},{"aliases":["石家河聚落群","城市","制陶","祭祀"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技","宗教"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-db0cff912750b1685e1ab8d6","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-db0cff912750b1685e1ab8d6","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-ba1114f1738518d5c017ed5c","summary":"石家河遗址群的制陶和祭祀材料，显示大型聚落内部并非只有住宅。三房湾发现陶窑、洗泥池、蓄水缸以及数摞套叠烧结的陶杯，支持这里存在专业制陶活动的判断。相关窑场在石家河文化晚期发展，并延续至后石家河阶段，不宜把全部遗迹定为同时出现。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3200—前2200年","end_year":-2200,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-3200},"title":"石家河聚落的制陶和祭祀活动"},{"aliases":["来源未给独立事件专名；据所列遗址、器物或行动描述拟题。","稻田","土地利用"],"body":[],"categories":["科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-c2385cc7c8b7407249cfa7ea","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-c2385cc7c8b7407249cfa7ea","record_type":"site","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-ea959246f3ca607f3d3bb8ee","summary":"茅山良渚时期稻田的田埂，提供了观察史前农业空间的具体材料。所引综述把有关田地置于约公元前3200至前2400年，描述长条形田块由较长、相互平行的田埂分开。这比单纯发现稻粒更进一步，让研究者能够讨论居民怎样划分和经营实际耕作地面。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3200—前2400年","end_year":-2400,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-3200},"title":"茅山稻田的田埂"},{"aliases":["Qixingdun site","城市","聚落布局"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-b9da2308f0bbdf753bfd08e0","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-b9da2308f0bbdf753bfd08e0","record_type":"site","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-0acaf65263ef2c7ca99d222b","summary":"七星墩遗址位于湖南，约公元前3000至前2000年的材料保存了一处双层史前城址。外层大体呈圆形，内层近于矩形，城内外还留下房屋、陶窑、墓葬和灰坑等遗迹。这种布局为认识长江中游南缘聚落的营建及不同区域用途提供了重要线索。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3000—前2000年","end_year":-2000,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-3000},"title":"七星墩双层城址"},{"aliases":["Sacred City of Caral-Supe","城市","土石建筑"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["卡拉尔—苏佩文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-aaa0bbff63cfae1a4ee82317","images":[{"caption":"卡拉尔考古区的现存墙体及现代遮棚，2022年摄影。","creator":"Ariana zafra","credit":"Ariana zafra / Wikimedia Commons / CC BY-SA 4.0","depiction_type":"modern_site_photograph","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","obligations":["保留作者、来源和许可证链接。","如改编图像，注明修改并以相同或兼容许可分享改编图像。","不对图像另加与本许可冲突的使用限制。"],"rights_revision_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3AHuaca+Caral+8.jpg&oldid=777607857","sha256":"342a3b7c9bfd21666608070e57db7ffe9c1d617b67467bf7b68a84c11bc2125f","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Huaca_Caral_8.jpg","src":"/api/history/assets/AS-342a3b7c9bfd21666608070e57db7ffe9c1d617b67467bf7b68a84c11bc2125f.jpg"}],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-aaa0bbff63cfae1a4ee82317","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-97e410832c6c350da457d88e","summary":"卡拉尔位于今秘鲁苏佩河谷旁的干旱台地，碳十四研究将其主要发展置于约公元前3000至前1800年。遗址中可见大型石土高台、下沉式圆形广场和居住建筑，建筑与开放空间相互组合，反映群体能够组织较大规模的公共营建。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3000—前1800年","end_year":-1800,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-3000},"title":"卡拉尔群体营建高台与下沉式圆形广场"},{"aliases":["Dholavira: a Harappan City","水管理","城市"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["哈拉帕文明"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-6830125453e8b2be3b08e47b","images":[{"caption":"多拉维拉水管理、排水通道的现存遗迹，2022年摄影。","creator":"Prof Ranga Sai","credit":"Prof Ranga Sai / Wikimedia Commons / CC BY-SA 4.0","depiction_type":"modern_site_photograph","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","obligations":["保留作者、来源和许可证链接。","如改编图像，注明修改并以相同或兼容许可分享改编图像。","不对图像另加与本许可冲突的使用限制。"],"rights_revision_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3AManholes+at+Dholavira+water+management+network.jpg&oldid=1223758466","sha256":"d3378781314189482ae79db296303fb91c03b188b0bde4e589d07d33eb87481e","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Manholes_at_Dholavira_water_management_network.jpg","src":"/api/history/assets/AS-d3378781314189482ae79db296303fb91c03b188b0bde4e589d07d33eb87481e.jpg"}],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-6830125453e8b2be3b08e47b","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-749abc2d3b0a0a310802e810","summary":"多拉维拉属于哈拉帕文明，位于今印度古吉拉特邦干旱的卡迪尔岛地，约在公元前3000至前1500年间有人居住。两条季节性溪流为城市提供稀缺水源，复杂的水管理设施成为理解这里如何维持生活的重要部分，也显示居民必须适应供水具有季节性的环境。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3000—前1500年","end_year":-1500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-3000},"title":"多拉维拉居民使用复杂水管理系统"},{"aliases":["The Neolithic Settlement of Burzahom","居住建筑","生活史"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-a931b99a7f349b23461c292e","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a931b99a7f349b23461c292e","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-7ac51d7f8dec2be8692d30ee","summary":"布尔扎霍姆遗址位于克什米尔地区，约公元前3000至前1000年的序列保存了居住形式的变化。早期居民在天然土中开挖圆形或椭圆形坑室，坑口附近的柱洞，使研究者推测上部曾有遮蔽物。坑内及地面附近的炉址等材料，为理解居住活动提供了线索。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3000—前1000年","end_year":-1000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-3000},"title":"布尔扎霍姆群体由坑穴住居转向地面泥砖建筑"},{"aliases":["Longshan culture","聚落考古"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["龙山文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-80a36b77f8ccd40098f1c334","images":[],"map_reference":{"checked_at":"2026-10-25","kind":"region_reference","label":"黄河","latitude":36.12419444444444,"license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/","longitude":116.09766666666667,"note":"本条所引原文明确涉及黄河；地图采用资料支持的地点范围，不表示精确场址或完整路线。 地理补录不代表整条史实已经终审。","precision":"region","role":"材料涉及地点","source_title":"Wikidata Q7355 · P625","source_url":"https://www.wikidata.org/w/index.php?title=Q7355&oldid=2541774085"},"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-80a36b77f8ccd40098f1c334","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-c9a126e1f2af7d6bf70f58b3","summary":"约公元前3000至前1900年的龙山文化，在黄河中下游留下多处有城墙的城镇和城外墓地。夯土墙以内可见公共建筑、道路和排水等设施，显示一些聚落已经具有较复杂的空间组织。与早先村落相比，人口和活动向有防护的中心汇聚，成为观察史前社会变化的重要现象。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3000年—公元前1900年","end_year":-1900,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-3000},"title":"龙山文化的城墙与墓地"},{"aliases":["来源未给独立事件专名；据所列遗址、器物或行动描述拟题。","城市","农业"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-d8a6fa523cb827839563b2e0","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-d8a6fa523cb827839563b2e0","record_type":"site","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-3c53df091ce53e677b95f88a","summary":"宝墩遗址是成都平原宝墩文化的命名地点，研究所用年代约为公元前二七〇〇至二一〇〇年。城址有内外两道城墙，总面积约二百四十五公顷，发掘发现生活垃圾灰坑和少量木骨泥墙房屋；其内部布局仍有许多不清楚之处，不能仅凭城墙规模复原完整城市制度。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前2700—前2100年","end_year":-2100,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-2700},"title":"宝墩城址与稻粟农业"},{"aliases":["Old Kingdom","建筑","王权"],"body":[],"categories":["艺术","宗教"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["古埃及"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-bef26913546db2808565f9de","images":[],"map_reference":{"checked_at":"2026-10-25","kind":"region_reference","label":"古埃及","latitude":29.8,"license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/","longitude":31.3,"note":"本条主体明确记载古埃及，地图表示该国家或历史政权的关联范围，不表示精确事件发生地点。 地理补录不代表整条史实已经终审。","precision":"country","role":"材料涉及国家或政权","source_title":"Wikidata Q11768 · P625","source_url":"https://www.wikidata.org/w/index.php?title=Q11768&oldid=2559681824"},"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-bef26913546db2808565f9de","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-cd8250730babdf9f99a81b4d","summary":"古王国时期，埃及法老把金字塔作为自己和王室成员的陵墓，以宏大的建筑表达王权与神的联系以及死后升入神界的信念。吉萨的胡夫金字塔是这一传统最醒目的实例之一，陵墓中放入家具、食物、饰物等物品，也与为来世准备生活所需的观念相连。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前2660年—公元前2160年","end_year":-2160,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-2660},"title":"古王国时期的金字塔营建"},{"aliases":["Great Pyramid of Giza","金字塔","建筑"],"body":[],"categories":["艺术","宗教"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["古王国埃及"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-52358c5bbc06e5e74416fbf5","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-52358c5bbc06e5e74416fbf5","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-6443e6362ef7cb5eff0ff035","summary":"约公元前2600年前后，埃及在吉萨为国王胡夫营建大金字塔。工程主体使用当地石灰岩，外表曾覆盖从图拉经水路运来的优质石灰岩，原高约一百四十六点五米。埃及文物部门估计营建历时十至二十年，但具体施工方法仍有未解之处，不能把现代推测写成已被完整证实的工序。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前2600年","end_year":-2600,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-2600},"title":"埃及营建胡夫大金字塔"}],"revision":"7b562b96d0ccc8b5ba7df896452b7871dfa5786438c7d8c232e7723b0fb28b2d","schema_version":"1.0.0","scope":"public_database","sources":[],"time_bounds":{"max_year":2026,"min_year":-10000}}